WEBVTT

00:11.011 --> 00:14.973
NOTES FROM THE LAST ROW

00:41.416 --> 00:44.836
Things suddenly took a strange turn
after he got a call.

01:42.435 --> 01:43.436
Se-yun?

01:45.647 --> 01:47.232
Se-yun!

01:47.315 --> 01:49.109
And it turned into a chase.

01:49.192 --> 01:50.235
Hey, stop!

02:04.415 --> 02:05.625
Mrs. Ahn?

02:07.377 --> 02:08.253
What are you…

02:17.345 --> 02:18.304
It was Eun-joo?

02:22.559 --> 02:23.768
It was dear Eun-joo?

02:28.773 --> 02:29.899
How could that…

02:30.650 --> 02:32.277
But the real shocker

02:33.153 --> 02:35.155
is that she knows more than anyone.

02:35.238 --> 02:37.490
The woman who we thought knew nothing!

02:38.408 --> 02:39.784
Why are you here?

02:42.745 --> 02:44.164
Did you follow me?

02:45.456 --> 02:47.792
No, I thought you were Se-yun.

02:50.628 --> 02:51.880
Why are you here, Mrs. Ahn?

02:53.339 --> 02:54.424
Se-yun?

02:56.676 --> 02:58.803
So you're the young man
who went to the hotel?

02:59.470 --> 03:01.347
The one who asked if it was a murder?

03:05.602 --> 03:06.603
You

03:08.396 --> 03:09.564
went to the hotel too?

03:17.030 --> 03:20.742
If you went to the hotel, you'll know.
It was just an accident.

03:20.825 --> 03:23.828
And this is a family matter.
It's none of your business!

03:24.329 --> 03:26.915
How can it be none of my business?
A person died.

03:27.415 --> 03:29.667
You know it wasn't an accident,
as the letter said.

03:34.130 --> 03:36.216
"I have the hospital CCTV footage."

03:38.885 --> 03:40.011
That letter.

03:42.096 --> 03:43.681
How much do you…

03:48.937 --> 03:50.230
What do you want?

03:50.897 --> 03:54.150
No, I don't want a thing. Don't worry.

03:54.234 --> 03:55.360
I just…

03:56.611 --> 03:59.072
I just want to know the truth. That's all.

04:01.157 --> 04:03.117
And I'm on your side.

04:04.369 --> 04:05.370
Not the police's.

04:08.373 --> 04:09.290
The police?

04:10.792 --> 04:13.044
If you won't tell me,
I have no other choice.

04:14.545 --> 04:16.506
To uncover the truth about her death.

04:20.677 --> 04:21.970
In the end,

04:22.720 --> 04:24.389
she told me everything.

04:26.516 --> 04:29.644
Everything she said was so shocking.
That's why I'm late.

04:29.727 --> 04:33.064
-I couldn't interrupt her. That's why I--
-Okay.

04:37.694 --> 04:38.861
I see.

04:39.487 --> 04:41.114
Okay. Calm down.

04:41.781 --> 04:44.325
Let's sit down first, and you can tell me.

04:48.746 --> 04:52.041
Now tell me everything you heard today.

04:52.875 --> 04:54.919
Don't leave anything out.

04:55.003 --> 04:56.004
All right.

04:56.963 --> 04:58.506
The story starts with--

04:58.589 --> 04:59.716
Wait, hold on.

05:23.531 --> 05:24.365
From now on…

05:26.326 --> 05:27.994
talk quietly. Softly.

05:28.745 --> 05:29.829
Okay, so…

05:40.381 --> 05:41.382
Yes, hello?

05:46.804 --> 05:47.764
Really?

05:49.223 --> 05:50.224
Okay.

05:51.559 --> 05:52.477
Yes, I understand.

05:53.478 --> 05:54.520
I'll head there now.

05:55.021 --> 05:57.065
Hey, what are you doing?

05:57.148 --> 05:57.982
What is it?

05:59.400 --> 06:02.278
I'm sorry.
I have something urgent to take care of.

06:03.613 --> 06:05.990
I'll call you later… no, tomorrow.

06:06.074 --> 06:07.700
Wait, tomorrow? Why?

06:07.784 --> 06:09.577
What is it?

06:10.161 --> 06:11.954
Did something happen to Eun-joo?

06:12.038 --> 06:13.456
Well? What is it?

06:13.539 --> 06:17.377
No, it doesn't concern Mrs. Ahn, but…

06:18.002 --> 06:20.129
Hey, you can't just leave like this!

06:20.213 --> 06:21.172
Wait.

06:22.256 --> 06:23.216
Lee Kang.

06:23.716 --> 06:24.634
Call me.

06:25.718 --> 06:27.345
Soon. Call as soon as you can!

06:36.604 --> 06:38.106
So when it comes to

06:39.399 --> 06:40.358
literary incidents,

06:41.317 --> 06:43.736
it's not the incident itself that matters.

06:48.199 --> 06:50.535
Rather, the focus is on

06:51.869 --> 06:55.873
what kind of person
gets caught up in said incident

06:56.374 --> 06:58.751
and what is revealed
about their character.

07:04.173 --> 07:06.134
You little punk. Where are you?

07:10.263 --> 07:14.308
Why haven't you called?
And why weren't you in…

07:14.392 --> 07:15.309
Hello.

07:15.393 --> 07:20.148
Why weren't you in class?
Call me as soon as you hear this, okay?

07:22.233 --> 07:23.067
Hey, Kim Se-yun!

07:30.450 --> 07:31.284
Do you…

07:31.951 --> 07:32.910
Yes, Professor?

07:34.245 --> 07:35.121
Do you…

07:37.582 --> 07:38.916
Do you know where Lee…

07:45.131 --> 07:46.507
Never mind.

07:47.300 --> 07:48.134
You can go.

08:04.025 --> 08:06.569
If you have any ideas

08:07.403 --> 08:10.156
for new general education
elective courses,

08:10.656 --> 08:12.617
now's a great time to share them.

08:14.410 --> 08:17.330
The university administration
has asked us to add

08:17.413 --> 08:19.624
more unique general education courses.

08:20.124 --> 08:21.125
Department Chair?

08:21.959 --> 08:23.711
LEE KANG

08:30.009 --> 08:31.010
Hey.

08:31.093 --> 08:34.263
I'm sorry, Mr. Heo.
I should have called sooner.

08:34.847 --> 08:35.973
Were you asleep?

08:36.516 --> 08:37.850
No, go ahead.

08:39.101 --> 08:41.521
Are you mad
because I didn't answer your calls?

08:42.021 --> 08:43.814
No, just talk.

08:44.357 --> 08:45.399
What happened?

08:48.194 --> 08:50.154
It's a pretty long story.

08:51.030 --> 08:52.198
The call I got yesterday

08:53.699 --> 08:55.284
was from the nursing home.

08:57.078 --> 09:00.456
You know about my dad being here
from my assignment, right?

09:01.666 --> 09:04.001
Anyway, they called to say
he'd gone missing,

09:04.669 --> 09:05.878
so I'm out of town.

09:08.297 --> 09:09.257
What, out of town?

09:09.340 --> 09:12.051
Yes, it's actually quite far.

09:22.228 --> 09:25.481
We found him, thankfully,
so you don't have to worry, but

09:26.857 --> 09:29.777
my dad's a little hurt.

09:31.153 --> 09:32.863
I'll have to stay here for a while.

09:32.947 --> 09:34.699
Hey, then what about our conversation?

09:36.742 --> 09:37.577
Sorry?

09:39.829 --> 09:40.663
Right, yeah.

09:41.914 --> 09:45.167
How's your father? Is he doing okay?

09:45.668 --> 09:49.255
You mentioned that he struggles
with alcoholism, didn't you?

09:49.338 --> 09:50.464
Yes, that's right.

09:51.424 --> 09:52.258
You remember.

09:52.883 --> 09:54.969
Of course I remember.

09:55.469 --> 09:57.179
I hope he gets better soon.

09:58.014 --> 09:58.931
But…

10:00.016 --> 10:03.394
Hey, what are we going to do
about our conversation?

10:04.145 --> 10:07.690
Is it possible for you to write it up
as your assignment?

10:11.485 --> 10:12.528
Assignment?

10:15.406 --> 10:18.159
I had to rush here,
so I couldn't bring my laptop.

10:18.993 --> 10:21.704
Or we could do it over the phone.
Let's do that.

10:21.787 --> 10:23.456
I'm free now. I have time.

10:23.539 --> 10:25.499
No, I can't talk for long.

10:30.379 --> 10:31.380
Okay, then.

10:32.048 --> 10:34.717
I'll try to borrow the computer
at the nursing home office.

10:35.426 --> 10:38.137
I can't finish it in one go,
but I'll try whenever I can.

10:38.220 --> 10:39.472
It might take about a week.

10:40.598 --> 10:41.932
What, a week?

10:42.016 --> 10:43.351
Kang!

10:43.851 --> 10:44.935
I have to go.

10:45.019 --> 10:47.313
My dad keeps asking for me.
I'll email you soon.

10:47.396 --> 10:49.148
Hey, Lee Kang! Wait!

10:51.442 --> 10:52.610
You bastard!

10:56.280 --> 10:57.531
What? A week?

11:00.910 --> 11:02.119
A whole week?

11:14.215 --> 11:18.302
He said he'd email me soon.
When exactly is "soon"?

11:19.387 --> 11:21.305
That little bastard.

11:27.269 --> 11:29.605
What the hell's with this bastard?

11:30.189 --> 11:33.109
Bastard drives like a goddamn maniac.

11:33.192 --> 11:34.402
Choi Dong-ju.

11:34.485 --> 11:35.319
Here.

11:38.406 --> 11:39.323
Choi Mi-gyeong.

11:39.407 --> 11:40.241
Here.

11:50.251 --> 11:53.087
Mr. Heo.
I just sent you my first assignment.

11:53.671 --> 11:56.590
I tried to write down
what Mrs. Ahn told me, word for word.

11:57.174 --> 11:58.300
Brace yourself.

12:04.223 --> 12:05.891
-Choi Bo-geom.
-Here.

12:13.858 --> 12:14.775
Well…

12:16.360 --> 12:19.864
I'm sorry, but today's class is canceled.

12:20.906 --> 12:23.200
I'll make up for this class next time.

12:24.702 --> 12:25.578
Sorry?

12:25.661 --> 12:26.704
Class is…

12:26.787 --> 12:27.913
Canceled? Seriously?

12:27.997 --> 12:29.665
What's gotten into the old fart?

12:30.416 --> 12:32.209
Let's go to an Internet café and chill.

12:41.343 --> 12:42.553
Professor, hello.

12:42.636 --> 12:45.556
When can you send
the exam questions for finals?

12:45.639 --> 12:46.474
Professor?

12:48.476 --> 12:49.310
What the heck?

12:49.894 --> 12:52.021
-Hello, sir.
-What's up with him lately?

13:11.540 --> 13:15.252
Actually, I've known for a long time

13:15.961 --> 13:18.339
that my husband was cheating on me.

13:18.839 --> 13:20.216
How could I not know?

13:22.510 --> 13:23.719
But

13:24.929 --> 13:27.264
I've never brought it up and asked him.

13:27.765 --> 13:30.017
My pride wouldn't let me.

13:31.685 --> 13:33.103
I can't forgive him.

13:36.565 --> 13:39.318
But I thought I could play dumb

13:40.653 --> 13:42.321
to protect my children.

13:43.823 --> 13:45.241
So I just put up with it.

13:46.033 --> 13:47.326
Endured it.

13:50.454 --> 13:51.580
But

13:53.040 --> 13:55.584
I couldn't just let it slide this time.

13:58.420 --> 14:00.589
In my home, of all places.

14:05.094 --> 14:07.555
In our own home, where my babies live.

14:11.016 --> 14:13.769
With the likes of
that worthless housekeeper.

15:45.069 --> 15:46.737
HAPPY TIME
PREGNANCY TEST KIT

16:24.650 --> 16:25.609
What are you doing?

16:28.988 --> 16:30.781
What is this, Min-hui?

16:31.365 --> 16:32.783
What's this doing here?

16:34.493 --> 16:35.411
Why is that…

16:41.166 --> 16:42.876
How would I know?

17:01.270 --> 17:05.274
You're still awake. What's wrong?
Should I turn off the lights?

17:06.692 --> 17:08.068
No, it's okay.

17:12.990 --> 17:13.991
What is it?

17:15.909 --> 17:17.619
Are you still upset over her?

17:18.120 --> 17:19.872
The fight you had earlier today?

17:20.998 --> 17:21.999
I don't know.

17:24.543 --> 17:26.336
It's bringing back memories.

17:27.337 --> 17:28.589
Min-hui

17:29.631 --> 17:31.675
used to wear my clothes without asking.

17:32.885 --> 17:34.344
Bringing that up again?

17:34.845 --> 17:38.599
You were going to donate them anyway,
so what's the big deal?

17:41.518 --> 17:42.936
Then what about the scarf?

17:44.104 --> 17:45.397
Why'd she steal what's mine?

17:46.065 --> 17:50.611
She said she never stole it
when I followed her out and asked.

17:50.694 --> 17:52.571
Maybe you were mistaken.

17:53.197 --> 17:54.239
Mistaken?

17:56.283 --> 17:59.411
Are you taking her side right now?

18:00.120 --> 18:01.830
I couldn't stand it.

18:02.498 --> 18:04.958
I had to put an end to it
before Yun found out.

18:22.226 --> 18:24.561
What brings you here, on a weekend,

18:26.313 --> 18:28.107
to a shabby neighborhood like this?

18:33.987 --> 18:35.906
Here to apologize or something?

18:41.745 --> 18:42.579
Why do you…

18:45.290 --> 18:47.501
I found it in your bag yesterday.

18:48.544 --> 18:50.712
I am aware of what this means.

18:52.631 --> 18:53.465
What it means?

18:56.760 --> 18:58.011
Seriously?

18:58.512 --> 19:00.055
So you think

19:01.014 --> 19:03.183
I'm pregnant
with your husband's baby, lady?

19:03.267 --> 19:04.101
What?

19:04.852 --> 19:05.811
"Lady"?

19:06.728 --> 19:08.772
It looks like I'll be fired anyway.

19:09.523 --> 19:12.234
Are you saying
I should call you "ma'am" even here?

19:14.903 --> 19:15.737
Fine.

19:17.865 --> 19:19.199
Call me whatever you want.

19:19.783 --> 19:20.909
But this…

19:24.538 --> 19:26.373
What is it that you want?

19:37.551 --> 19:38.927
Look, lady.

19:39.553 --> 19:41.847
No, you've got it all wrong.

19:42.806 --> 19:43.765
Ridiculous.

19:45.684 --> 19:46.810
You're crazy.

19:47.311 --> 19:48.854
Completely insane.

19:52.733 --> 19:53.817
Listen up,

19:54.401 --> 19:55.694
lady.

19:57.863 --> 19:59.072
This

19:59.990 --> 20:02.910
has nothing to do
with your husband whatsoever.

20:04.077 --> 20:05.621
This is my private life.

20:07.080 --> 20:09.249
What do you take me for?

20:12.127 --> 20:13.253
Sure.

20:14.046 --> 20:17.299
It would be nice to snare a rich guy
with something like this.

20:18.383 --> 20:20.177
But not your husband.

20:22.221 --> 20:25.432
Think I'm mad enough to mess around
with a vile bastard like him?

20:26.016 --> 20:29.061
Think I'm like the bitches
he fools around with behind your back?

20:30.687 --> 20:33.232
Who do you think he is?
You really think he's all that?

20:34.858 --> 20:35.984
Don't be stupid.

20:37.277 --> 20:40.030
That husband of yours
is just a revolting hypocrite,

20:40.113 --> 20:42.032
a thief who's fooling the world…

20:45.118 --> 20:47.704
and a fucking loser.

20:49.706 --> 20:51.291
You don't even know a thing.

20:52.751 --> 20:54.253
What? Thief?

20:55.587 --> 20:56.880
What do you mean…

21:05.514 --> 21:07.975
What she told me was so shocking.

21:08.517 --> 21:10.477
A secret of my husband's

21:11.061 --> 21:12.854
that I could never have imagined.

21:15.565 --> 21:16.650
TO BE CONTINUED..

21:18.819 --> 21:21.738
Continued. To be continued.
It's always "to be continued.."!

21:23.615 --> 21:24.616
Unbelievable.

21:47.389 --> 21:48.307
Did you know…

21:52.060 --> 21:54.604
Hyeong-jong's book launch is
the day after tomorrow?

21:55.188 --> 21:56.398
Seong-hui called.

21:56.898 --> 21:57.733
Yeah.

21:58.525 --> 22:01.737
I called Professor Park to say
I can't make it. You can go by yourself.

22:03.447 --> 22:05.365
I hear Kim Su-hun will be there.

22:16.001 --> 22:19.046
And what exactly did Kim Su-hun steal?

22:19.546 --> 22:21.840
What theft did he commit, exactly?

22:26.720 --> 22:30.349
Yes, I know that you're busy
and have your hands full.

22:30.849 --> 22:34.644
So just tell me that first.
There's a reason I need to know now.

22:36.605 --> 22:37.522
Hey, Lee Kang.

22:38.231 --> 22:39.066
Lee Kang?

22:42.652 --> 22:44.738
That little shit.

23:00.504 --> 23:01.463
So,

23:02.798 --> 23:04.508
that theft he committed…

23:08.261 --> 23:09.596
There's no way.

23:14.976 --> 23:16.728
I have an older sister.

23:17.437 --> 23:18.688
I mean, "had."

23:19.940 --> 23:22.401
She was the only family member
I was attached to,

23:23.860 --> 23:25.529
but she died of cancer last year.

23:28.949 --> 23:31.326
I only found out after her funeral

23:32.494 --> 23:33.745
that her dream…

23:36.123 --> 23:37.541
was to become a writer.

23:46.049 --> 23:48.093
SHOULD I TELL MIN-HUI ABOUT MY DIAGNOSIS?

23:48.176 --> 23:50.220
THE DAY I FINISH THIS NOVEL,
I'LL BE CURED

24:06.570 --> 24:09.281
GUESTS AFTER DARK
SEON EUN-HUI

24:15.704 --> 24:17.247
Mom, what are you reading?

24:18.331 --> 24:19.166
What?

24:19.958 --> 24:22.627
Just something your aunt wrote.

24:24.337 --> 24:27.340
I always cursed her out
for shutting herself up in her room.

24:27.841 --> 24:29.468
Guess she was writing this crap.

24:31.136 --> 24:32.721
Still, it must be good.

24:33.680 --> 24:35.765
I've never seen you read anything before.

24:38.643 --> 24:39.478
Sweetheart.

24:41.771 --> 24:44.691
Should I try to send this to a publisher?

24:45.192 --> 24:46.693
Publishers print books, right?

24:47.736 --> 24:48.570
Books?

24:49.404 --> 24:51.156
It might make us some money.

24:51.656 --> 24:54.326
Then I could pay
for my smart girl's education

24:54.826 --> 24:56.036
and open a hair salon.

24:56.703 --> 24:58.121
Sure, try sending it.

24:58.914 --> 25:02.125
You said the man you work for
makes a ton of money, too, right?

25:31.696 --> 25:34.157
Mr. Kim, sorry to interrupt.

25:35.158 --> 25:37.786
The manuscript I gave you last time.

25:38.286 --> 25:39.538
Did you read it?

25:40.455 --> 25:43.124
I've been waiting,
but you haven't said anything about it.

25:44.167 --> 25:45.293
About what?

25:46.836 --> 25:49.881
You know, the thing I gave you last time.
My sister's novel.

25:49.965 --> 25:51.758
I asked if you could read it.

25:56.930 --> 25:57.764
That.

25:58.932 --> 25:59.933
I'm sorry.

26:01.726 --> 26:03.478
My book's coming out soon,

26:04.145 --> 26:06.856
so I don't have time
to read someone's rough draft.

26:10.860 --> 26:11.695
Okay.

26:12.195 --> 26:15.240
And you don't have to clean
when I'm working.

26:16.366 --> 26:18.577
I thought I told you last time.

26:30.213 --> 26:32.424
Then could I have it back?

26:33.174 --> 26:35.218
I was going to send it to a publisher.

26:37.304 --> 26:38.513
Well,

26:39.222 --> 26:41.016
it should be around here somewhere.

26:41.516 --> 26:42.934
Where did I put it again?

26:44.352 --> 26:45.395
That's

26:46.396 --> 26:48.815
the only copy of the manuscript.

26:54.779 --> 26:56.072
All right.

26:56.865 --> 26:58.742
I'll find it and give it back to you.

27:08.710 --> 27:12.464
I only found out
after your husband's book was published.

27:14.382 --> 27:15.216
Wait.

27:24.893 --> 27:26.978
What the fuck is this?

27:30.482 --> 27:31.524
EYES OF THE HOUSE

27:33.777 --> 27:36.112
I don't know what you're talking about.

27:37.489 --> 27:38.782
How are the two the same?

27:39.449 --> 27:41.034
Do you think I'm an idiot?

27:43.328 --> 27:45.121
A poor woman with no home…

27:46.247 --> 27:48.750
So, a woman who likes
looking around people's homes

27:48.833 --> 27:51.586
sneaks into a rich couple's house
while they're on vacation

27:51.670 --> 27:53.672
and secretly stays there. That's the same.

27:54.673 --> 27:58.551
And here. The part where she finds
a body in the fridge is also the same.

27:58.635 --> 27:59.719
Lady.

28:00.845 --> 28:01.888
Lady?

28:03.473 --> 28:05.600
Lady, what are you saying?

28:06.226 --> 28:08.353
Such a claim could get you in big trouble.

28:09.688 --> 28:11.314
What do you know about literature?

28:12.524 --> 28:14.651
Do you even know what a story is?

28:15.610 --> 28:18.279
If you keep making
such baseless accusations,

28:18.780 --> 28:20.448
you'll have to face legal action.

28:23.076 --> 28:25.745
I don't fucking care. Cut the bullshit!

28:27.414 --> 28:29.541
You think I'll just let this slide?

28:29.624 --> 28:31.793
You really don't get it.

28:33.169 --> 28:35.547
Do you have any proof
that I plagiarized her work?

28:36.548 --> 28:37.382
Proof?

28:37.882 --> 28:38.717
Yeah.

28:40.468 --> 28:43.388
Without proof,
who do you think would believe you?

28:46.725 --> 28:47.684
I have it.

28:48.184 --> 28:49.144
Proof.

28:55.066 --> 28:56.526
My sister's novel.

28:59.279 --> 29:00.905
I have the original file.

29:09.080 --> 29:10.331
From that day on,

29:10.832 --> 29:13.501
your husband was totally at my mercy.

29:38.943 --> 29:42.197
One word from me
could ruin his whole life.

29:42.739 --> 29:44.616
A pathetic little fucker.

29:48.453 --> 29:49.496
This is epic!

29:51.873 --> 29:55.460
Wow, is this honestly real? Is it?

29:57.170 --> 29:59.005
She called him a pathetic little fucker.

30:01.674 --> 30:05.094
He really is completely insane, isn't he?

30:06.221 --> 30:08.014
Mr. Kim Su-hun.

30:08.097 --> 30:10.141
Kim Su-hun. Hey, Su-hun!

30:10.642 --> 30:16.105
How could an esteemed author like you
steal someone else's novel?

30:16.189 --> 30:18.775
You crazy son of a bitch,
you fucking nutjob.

30:18.858 --> 30:21.945
So that's all you were, huh?

30:26.574 --> 30:28.368
All right, you son of a bitch.

30:29.244 --> 30:31.538
Let me see

30:32.288 --> 30:33.790
just how shameless you are.

30:39.838 --> 30:43.591
Hey, it's me. I'm going.
I'll attend the thing.

30:45.885 --> 30:47.345
What are you talking about?

30:47.428 --> 30:49.889
I'll attend Professor Park's book launch.

30:54.894 --> 30:56.104
Why all of a sudden?

30:59.065 --> 31:00.275
I guess you found out.

31:01.526 --> 31:05.238
Found out what?
What are you talking about?

31:05.321 --> 31:08.449
Kim Su-hun's wife.
She's going to be there too.

31:09.534 --> 31:11.286
Isn't that what changed your mind?

31:14.956 --> 31:17.166
Why didn't you tell me this earlier?

31:18.585 --> 31:20.169
I suggested that she be invited.

31:21.504 --> 31:22.755
You did? Why?

31:23.798 --> 31:26.134
I just wanted to see
what kind of woman she is.

31:26.217 --> 31:29.053
Why would you meet Eun-joo?
What are you planning to do?

31:31.389 --> 31:33.641
She's going through a hard time right now.

31:34.183 --> 31:36.227
She has a lot on her mind.

32:05.214 --> 32:07.091
No, you're lying.

32:08.426 --> 32:10.470
He'd never do something like that.

32:11.346 --> 32:13.640
Do you know how many books he's written?

32:14.390 --> 32:15.350
How could he…

32:17.393 --> 32:19.103
steal someone's work like that?

32:20.396 --> 32:21.981
For fuck's sake.

32:23.399 --> 32:24.233
Look.

32:25.485 --> 32:28.237
Are you having trouble believing,
or do you just not want to?

32:32.158 --> 32:32.992
See this?

32:34.994 --> 32:37.997
That bastard nearly killed me yesterday.

33:11.948 --> 33:13.116
Is that true?

33:14.283 --> 33:15.243
What?

33:17.203 --> 33:19.122
That you have the original file.

33:19.789 --> 33:24.877
Fucking hell.
If you don't want to believe me, don't.

33:25.795 --> 33:27.714
I can just upload it online.

33:28.589 --> 33:30.174
Then give it to me.

33:30.675 --> 33:31.509
Sell it to me.

33:52.238 --> 33:53.364
Would this be enough?

34:13.384 --> 34:16.304
If I'd known this would happen,
I'd have told you sooner.

34:18.222 --> 34:19.891
Now we're talking.

34:20.933 --> 34:22.185
That bastard

34:22.977 --> 34:24.312
was way too stingy.

34:29.776 --> 34:31.652
Bring it to work with you on Monday.

34:33.863 --> 34:35.782
I'll have the money ready.

35:08.314 --> 35:09.941
Yes, hello?

35:10.900 --> 35:11.734
Excuse me?

35:12.443 --> 35:13.611
The police?

35:14.445 --> 35:16.697
In the end, she never made it to work

35:17.532 --> 35:19.367
because she died on Sunday night.

35:23.704 --> 35:24.997
After that day…

35:26.833 --> 35:28.584
many things changed.

35:32.797 --> 35:34.799
Was it really a car accident?

35:35.925 --> 35:36.801
What if

35:38.469 --> 35:40.012
her death wasn't an accident?

35:57.488 --> 35:59.574
I couldn't just sit around.

36:00.741 --> 36:03.119
I had to find out the truth
about her death.

36:07.039 --> 36:07.874
A murder?

36:08.749 --> 36:10.960
I was able to confirm
that it was a car accident,

36:11.544 --> 36:13.880
but it did nothing to ease the burden.

36:13.963 --> 36:16.174
No, don't ask the church volunteer group.

36:17.717 --> 36:19.635
No? Why not?

36:19.719 --> 36:21.637
Fundraising or whatever…

36:23.556 --> 36:24.932
would take too long.

36:25.016 --> 36:27.351
The funeral should be held
as soon as possible.

36:29.061 --> 36:31.814
People might talk.

36:32.607 --> 36:35.193
That would be disrespectful
to the deceased.

36:36.235 --> 36:38.362
If money's the issue,
we can take care of it.

36:39.238 --> 36:40.281
I'll pay for it.

36:43.117 --> 36:44.285
You will?

36:45.912 --> 36:48.414
-Just run.
-What's your name? How old?

36:52.793 --> 36:54.503
She's so mature for her age.

36:54.587 --> 36:57.340
It's almost concerning.
She doesn't even cry.

36:58.549 --> 37:00.718
What will happen to her now?

37:01.219 --> 37:04.889
Luckily, we were able to get in touch
with her grandmother in the States.

37:04.972 --> 37:06.224
She leaves in two months.

37:08.184 --> 37:09.810
I'm relieved to hear

37:10.561 --> 37:12.271
she has family who'll take her in.

37:12.897 --> 37:16.025
I guess Eun-seo's mom
had one last bit of luck.

37:16.108 --> 37:17.526
She was able to have a funeral,

37:17.610 --> 37:19.654
albeit belatedly,
thanks to a friend like you.

37:20.488 --> 37:23.491
How did you say you knew her again?

37:26.702 --> 37:27.703
If you could

37:28.621 --> 37:31.874
use this money for the child's
travel expenses to the States…

37:35.628 --> 37:37.880
I was indebted to her.

37:38.589 --> 37:39.882
This is only part of it.

37:42.802 --> 37:43.761
Director?

37:44.679 --> 37:45.554
Yes?

37:46.222 --> 37:47.723
I solved all the questions.

38:03.114 --> 38:05.408
The funeral is tomorrow.

38:06.534 --> 38:08.577
Did you pick your mom's memorial portrait?

38:39.150 --> 38:41.694
It's okay. Don't cry.

38:43.404 --> 38:44.488
It's okay.

39:00.671 --> 39:02.715
Hey, Eun-seo, your mom…

39:05.134 --> 39:06.969
Did your mom…

39:09.347 --> 39:13.351
Did she, by any chance,

39:14.352 --> 39:15.978
have some sort of file?

39:17.605 --> 39:18.898
A USB?

39:33.371 --> 39:34.330
This?

39:38.125 --> 39:40.127
Mom said it was important

39:40.878 --> 39:42.922
and told me to keep it safe.

39:45.925 --> 39:47.593
The thing is, Eun-seo,

39:48.386 --> 39:49.804
this isn't actually

39:50.846 --> 39:51.680
your mom's.

39:56.143 --> 39:57.520
It's mine.

40:11.951 --> 40:14.203
I was just like him.

40:15.329 --> 40:17.331
No different from my husband.

40:18.082 --> 40:20.876
A disgusting, revolting person.

40:38.602 --> 40:42.398
Happy birthday to you

40:42.481 --> 40:45.943
Happy birthday to you

40:46.026 --> 40:50.156
Happy birthday, dear Dad

40:50.239 --> 40:52.116
Happy birthday to you

40:52.199 --> 40:53.909
A WONDERFUL HUSBAND, DEPENDABLE DAD

41:04.086 --> 41:05.796
This is where it ends.

41:07.840 --> 41:09.383
It's all over now.

41:19.185 --> 41:21.395
Happy birthday, Dad!

41:21.479 --> 41:23.731
Thanks, everyone.

41:23.814 --> 41:25.441
Thank you, honey.

41:25.524 --> 41:26.734
My goodness.

41:32.781 --> 41:35.784
TO BE CONTINUED..

41:46.670 --> 41:50.257
How does this make any sense?
How is this even possible?

41:52.343 --> 41:53.177
Look.

41:54.553 --> 41:58.432
She clearly knew what her husband did,

41:59.391 --> 42:02.978
so why would she get rid of the evidence
and even let him hug her?

42:03.479 --> 42:06.774
Why are you getting mad at me?
I just wrote what I heard.

42:06.857 --> 42:08.984
I'm not mad at you, you punk!

42:09.735 --> 42:13.822
It's just frustrating that she's covering
for her scumbag husband, goddammit!

42:14.323 --> 42:15.282
Mr. Heo.

42:16.075 --> 42:17.660
Are you jealous?

42:17.743 --> 42:18.869
What? Jealous?

42:19.745 --> 42:22.331
You little punk. How dare you!

42:27.878 --> 42:29.505
Let's take my car today.

42:31.924 --> 42:33.425
That top is almost see-through.

42:34.677 --> 42:36.095
You really dolled yourself up.

42:37.096 --> 42:39.098
You're the one who dolled yourself up.

42:39.640 --> 42:42.226
I guess you wanted to look sharp
for a certain someone.

42:53.195 --> 42:54.029
What's wrong?

42:55.197 --> 42:56.282
Stomach cramps.

42:57.449 --> 42:58.826
Since yesterday.

43:02.746 --> 43:03.998
Should I drive?

43:11.088 --> 43:12.047
Why don't you…

43:14.466 --> 43:15.676
just stay home today?

43:18.846 --> 43:19.680
What?

43:22.057 --> 43:25.603
Stomach cramps are no joke.
Go home and get some rest.

43:26.228 --> 43:27.896
I can go by myself.

43:30.608 --> 43:32.359
You don't want me to go, do you?

43:33.902 --> 43:34.987
Here you go again.

43:35.946 --> 43:39.325
I'm just worried about you, that's all.

43:39.867 --> 43:41.994
We're not getting any younger.

43:42.077 --> 43:45.623
We have to rest whenever we're sick.
That's the only answer.

43:51.462 --> 43:52.713
Fine.

43:54.298 --> 43:55.215
Go by yourself.

44:00.721 --> 44:02.014
Go. Go on.

44:08.646 --> 44:10.981
I'll be back soon. Go in and rest up.

44:11.065 --> 44:14.610
And if it gets worse, go see a doctor.

44:49.186 --> 44:52.231
We'll now hear from
Professor Park Hyeong-jong,

44:52.314 --> 44:54.692
the author of
Designing a Sustainable Future.

44:54.775 --> 44:56.443
Let's invite him on stage.

44:56.527 --> 44:58.696
A big round of applause, please.

45:01.573 --> 45:03.909
Thank you.

45:06.704 --> 45:11.625
The host just gave
such a wonderful introduction

45:11.709 --> 45:13.502
that I'm honestly overwhelmed.

45:14.294 --> 45:18.966
I didn't expect so many of you to come,
but thanks to you, filling up the seats,

45:19.466 --> 45:22.845
I feel like I've become
a best-selling author.

45:23.929 --> 45:25.431
Call me delusional, but hey.

45:25.514 --> 45:29.017
I'll work hard to become
a best-selling author, maybe.

45:30.436 --> 45:31.979
-Right, so today…
-You're here.

45:32.062 --> 45:34.398
I'd like to extend my heartfelt gratitude…

45:34.481 --> 45:35.858
Where's Hyeon-suk?

45:35.941 --> 45:39.528
…to you all for coming all this way
to attend the launch of my book.

45:39.611 --> 45:42.656
-Designing a Sustainable Future.
-They're not coming today.

45:42.740 --> 45:45.701
-Something urgent came up.
-I'm truly humbled by your support.

45:45.784 --> 45:46.744
Thank you so much.

45:53.000 --> 45:54.668
Why didn't you tell me?

45:56.003 --> 45:58.714
You should have told me
you were sick sooner.

46:00.340 --> 46:03.260
I didn't want you to worry.

46:05.095 --> 46:08.390
I'm okay now. Don't worry.

46:08.891 --> 46:13.437
Please, how can I not worry?
Do you know how scared I was?

46:15.606 --> 46:19.151
Please don't get sick anymore, okay?

46:20.277 --> 46:21.695
Okay.

47:21.880 --> 47:23.674
I thought everything would be over

47:24.174 --> 47:26.218
once I buried that secret.

47:26.885 --> 47:28.136
But it wasn't.

47:29.721 --> 47:32.891
Yun, what are you doing? Come out here.

47:34.184 --> 47:35.644
Jeong-hu's leaving.

47:54.037 --> 47:55.664
What's wrong, Yun?

47:59.293 --> 48:00.919
Are you not feeling well?

48:04.548 --> 48:07.968
Are you still upset about
what happened to Min-hui?

48:14.558 --> 48:16.518
How long are you going to keep this up?

48:17.352 --> 48:19.313
I have my limits too.

48:19.396 --> 48:21.565
Get up, Kim Se-yun.

48:21.648 --> 48:24.359
Now. Listen to your mother!

48:27.362 --> 48:28.989
They've already had her funeral.

48:29.072 --> 48:32.284
It's all over. When are you going to
stop acting like a child?

48:32.367 --> 48:34.661
What do you mean, it's over?

48:36.580 --> 48:38.332
You have no idea, Mom.

48:41.251 --> 48:42.711
You don't know.

48:43.712 --> 48:45.631
You don't know anything.

48:45.714 --> 48:50.302
That was when it all truly began.

48:53.472 --> 48:54.806
Oh my God!

49:01.396 --> 49:02.397
You…

49:07.444 --> 49:08.737
You were there?

49:09.404 --> 49:10.530
I saw it.

49:12.491 --> 49:13.617
I saw everything.

49:14.993 --> 49:16.662
What Dad did.

49:17.913 --> 49:19.623
Look, she's bleeding! My God.

49:19.706 --> 49:20.916
Can you move?

49:24.211 --> 49:26.838
-She's alive.
-She is.

49:30.342 --> 49:32.761
Please step aside.

49:43.397 --> 49:44.564
Please step aside.

49:44.648 --> 49:46.566
She's unconscious. Oh dear.

49:47.859 --> 49:48.986
Okay, let's lift her.

49:49.069 --> 49:50.654
Three, two, lift!

49:53.365 --> 49:55.117
Three, two, one.

49:55.200 --> 49:56.493
Let's move.

49:57.828 --> 49:58.745
Min-hui

49:59.329 --> 50:03.000
was definitely conscious then.

50:20.684 --> 50:22.644
Please keep tailing that car.

50:37.325 --> 50:39.202
Come on, sir.

50:53.133 --> 50:55.552
She was conscious when brought in.
What happened?

50:55.635 --> 50:58.180
I'm not sure.
I stepped out for a moment, and…

50:58.263 --> 51:00.182
-Get ready to perform CPR.
-Will do.

51:08.065 --> 51:10.150
-Please page the clinical fellow.
-Sure.

51:11.109 --> 51:12.944
No pulse. She's in cardiac arrest.

51:13.028 --> 51:14.654
Start compressions. Now.

51:14.738 --> 51:16.656
Starting compressions, now!

51:32.923 --> 51:34.674
-Epinephrine every three minutes.
-Yes.

51:35.258 --> 51:37.844
-Intubate her as soon as we're ready.
-Understood.

52:04.079 --> 52:04.996
So…

52:08.250 --> 52:10.127
So, your housekeeper…

52:11.628 --> 52:13.088
With your own two hands…

52:25.642 --> 52:27.018
No, Yun.

52:29.604 --> 52:31.022
Not yet.

52:33.108 --> 52:34.568
Nothing is certain.

52:34.651 --> 52:37.988
No, it was Dad's car.
It was definitely Dad!

52:40.115 --> 52:42.242
Dad did something to her.

52:46.121 --> 52:47.122
My baby.

52:52.043 --> 52:53.753
I hoped you'd never find out.

53:02.637 --> 53:03.513
Mom.

53:05.265 --> 53:06.600
How did you…

53:10.187 --> 53:11.646
How long have you known?

53:15.483 --> 53:16.443
Yun.

53:17.903 --> 53:20.030
That's not important right now.

53:21.698 --> 53:24.075
Stop crying and listen to me.

53:25.118 --> 53:27.704
We now have to find out

53:28.330 --> 53:29.331
what Dad really did…

53:31.208 --> 53:33.001
for ourselves.

53:36.046 --> 53:37.172
How?

53:45.513 --> 53:49.768
How about we go see a late-night movie
after this? It's been a while.

53:50.769 --> 53:51.895
A late-night movie?

53:53.313 --> 53:55.065
Or we could just go for a drive.

53:56.107 --> 53:57.400
Doesn't that sound wonderful?

53:57.484 --> 53:59.861
It'd be a waste to stay home
on a night like this.

53:59.945 --> 54:03.615
No, I can't. I have plans,
so I have to go out in a bit.

54:12.916 --> 54:16.253
You go to the hospital.
I'll go to the park.

54:16.336 --> 54:18.088
When I meet your dad there,

54:18.838 --> 54:21.091
I'm going to question him
about everything.

54:22.050 --> 54:26.471
In the meantime, you have to check
the hospital's CCTV footage.

54:27.514 --> 54:28.515
Got it?

55:10.849 --> 55:13.268
Hey, Jeong-hu.
Why are you calling me so late?

55:13.768 --> 55:14.728
What?

55:16.896 --> 55:19.274
Yun knows everything? What does he know?

55:22.902 --> 55:23.862
Jeong-hu.

55:24.571 --> 55:26.990
I have no idea what you're talking about.

55:27.574 --> 55:28.825
Let's meet up first.

55:29.868 --> 55:31.202
Let's talk in person.

55:57.354 --> 55:58.396
Hey, Yun.

55:59.356 --> 56:00.231
Did you find it?

56:00.732 --> 56:01.858
Did you check it?

56:14.871 --> 56:15.705
Se-yun.

56:21.878 --> 56:23.922
Yun was crying.

56:25.548 --> 56:27.550
He said the footage was useless.

56:30.261 --> 56:33.223
It was in a blind spot,
so he couldn't see anything.

56:38.478 --> 56:40.855
It's over now. It's all over.

56:41.648 --> 56:45.568
We lost all the evidence we could've used
to get a confession out of him.

56:48.780 --> 56:50.240
This is all my fault.

56:51.074 --> 56:53.284
I shouldn't have gotten rid of that file.

56:56.079 --> 56:58.706
I don't know how I'll face him
from now on.

57:01.751 --> 57:03.545
It's so scary, so horrifying.

57:11.219 --> 57:12.887
I don't know what to do now.

57:16.182 --> 57:19.102
How am I meant to go on living?

57:28.361 --> 57:29.404
Eun-joo.

57:32.365 --> 57:33.241
It's okay.

57:37.078 --> 57:38.329
I'll help you.

57:40.248 --> 57:41.666
I'll do whatever it takes.

57:50.383 --> 57:51.634
Don't worry.

58:05.231 --> 58:10.361
MR. HEO MUN-OH

58:26.044 --> 58:26.878
Lee Kang.

58:28.213 --> 58:29.297
Listen carefully.

58:29.964 --> 58:31.174
That evidence.

58:32.217 --> 58:33.760
We can make it ourselves.

58:35.762 --> 58:36.930
What do you mean by--

58:37.013 --> 58:39.140
Just listen to me, you punk!

58:41.142 --> 58:44.395
That night,
the night of Seon Min-hui's accident.

58:44.938 --> 58:47.440
You followed her to the hospital, okay?

58:48.024 --> 58:50.235
You followed Kim Su-hun to the hospital.

58:51.736 --> 58:52.570
What?

58:52.654 --> 58:53.905
And there,

58:54.948 --> 58:56.366
you witnessed it.

59:16.970 --> 59:19.514
You saw it with your own two eyes.

59:20.098 --> 59:21.349
Do you understand me?

59:22.350 --> 59:23.476
Mr. Heo.

59:24.561 --> 59:26.271
That will be how…

59:28.356 --> 59:29.983
your story ends.

59:34.404 --> 59:37.407
NOTES FROM THE LAST ROW

01:02:03.511 --> 01:02:08.516
Subtitle translation by: Jimin Choi
